    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d113">

                <pb facs="0206" n="860" xml:id="pg860"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Sutter to Mr. Foster</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Acapulco</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1875-01-28"><hi rendition="#italic">January</hi>
                        28.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#center">[Received in Mexico 28th, 7 p.m.]</p>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Minister of the United
                    States</hi>:</p>
                <p>Indians and coast-guard threaten Acapulco if the <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >cura</hi> is arrested. The federal garrison insufficient to sustain the
                    judge of the district. National guards under arms. The governor <hi
                        rendition="#italic">en route</hi> for Acapulco.</p>
                <closer><signed>J. A. SUTTER.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
